# Closed constructions. Trigger → pred → last mark.
# Two-place of/isa only. Verbs, clf, from/to are events, not use-lines.
# Anything not listed here is not compiled; the turn is world-miss.

form mwl {

  use copula isa copula
  use de has de
  use cmp than than
  use with with with
  use nohave has has
  use have has has
  use loc at at

}
